==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἐρωτικός||related to love}}, which is from {{m|grc|ἔρως||passionate or sexual love}}; {{confix|eroto|mania|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪniə|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# a [[disorder]] in which a person has a [[delusion]] of a romantic relationship with another person
# excessive sexual [[inclination]] or [[desire]]

